{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10127060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10127060","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1012706001:0":{"text":"我们……是不是赢了？","source_cn":"我们……是不是赢了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F3CE1A6F7B4FC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012706002:0":{"text":"起码，我已经彻底感受不到伊米尔的气息了。","source_cn":"起码，我已经彻底感受不到伊米尔的气息了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x435AE49BE9FBEB06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012706003:0":{"text":"愚蠢的男人，最终还是没能逃过弥萨忒的制裁。","source_cn":"愚蠢的男人，最终还是没能逃过弥萨忒的制裁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E7C0D6AE6D5FFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012706004:0":{"text":"伊米尔夺走的生命力已经被翡绿之卵尽数吸收。只要把翡绿之卵带回流荧树下，这些力量便会归还。","source_cn":"伊米尔夺走的生命力已经被翡绿之卵尽数吸收。只要把翡绿之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA5FDC989CEEEB53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012706005:0":{"text":"孩子们，都结束了。","source_cn":"孩子们，都结束了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE70B279B5D0312C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012706006:0":{"text":"我说雅顿老师，这时候不再高兴一点吗？","source_cn":"我说雅顿老师，这时候不再高兴一点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x672D25B19A73DE6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012706007:0":{"text":"——呀吼！终于结束啦！\n得这么庆祝才对吧？最好再作诗一首，以示纪念。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>——呀吼！终于结束啦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C7AB10782E177CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1012706008:0":{"text":"还没完呢！那个蓝头发的女人跑哪去了？！","source_cn":"还没完呢！那个蓝头发的女人跑哪去了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0ACBD7F18B68F1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1012706009:0":{"text":"在伊米尔倒下之前，她趁我们无暇顾及，用魔法逃走了。","source_cn":"在伊米尔倒下之前，她趁我们无暇顾及，用魔法逃走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03F88F6373B6B977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1012706010:0":{"text":"该死的家伙……她要是再敢打丛林的主意，我非得将她大卸八块！","source_cn":"该死的家伙……她要是再敢打丛林的主意，我非得将她大卸八块！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B08FDC2EADBBB6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1012706011:0":{"text":"噢呵呵……达赫妮，经此一役，孩子们都变得强大了不少，那个女人大概不敢再回来了。","source_cn":"噢呵呵……达赫妮，经此一役，孩子们都变得强大了不少，那...","st